.DS_Store
pipeline_info/*.{html,json,txt,yml}

# Excluded from content-snapshotting (paths are still checked via stable_path):
# - deeploc2/signalp6/deepcoil2/deeptmhmm outputs embed floating-point neural-net scores
#   that drift ~0.1-0.3% run-to-run/hardware-to-hardware (confirmed empirically while
#   building tests/testdata/, see PLAN.md Stage 5), and deeptmhmm's exact TM-region count
#   can shift by one at borderline boundaries depending on batch composition.
# - interproscan's TSV embeds the run date as a literal column, so it is never stable
#   across days.
# - rga/ (rga_classify) inherits the same nondeterminism/dates transitively (it's derived
#   from the five above) and also embeds its own run timestamp in run_metadata.json,
#   report.html and report.md.
# - summary_report/ (rga_report) has no timestamp of its own but its counts are derived
#   from rga_predictions.tsv, so it inherits the same transitive nondeterminism as rga/.
# Ground-truth value checks for all of these live in each module's own nf-test instead
# (modules/local/*/tests/main.nf.test), which assert on the stable, discrete part of each
# result (e.g. the predicted class or "has a signal peptide"), not exact floats/dates.
deeploc2/**
signalp6/**
deepcoil2/**
deeptmhmm/**
interproscan/**
rga/**
summary_report/**
